35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that renting a whole house is about 5,400 yen a head a night.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I saw that all-in rates charge the same for everyone, regardless of appetite.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I learned that in the shared house year, there was nowhere to be alone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ferry takes two days total, but the train to the spa is only ninety minutes.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The inn baths are open late, but the island houses have only one bathroom.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, does the all-in rate mean we don't have to split food bills?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, but it means I pay for food I might not eat. I prefer knowing the total.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, ninety minutes is much better than two days. That sounds efficient.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,It is. The train option saves us a lot of waiting and moving.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,One bathroom for the whole building sounds stressful for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"I also checked last year's separate rooms. They varied by 8,000 yen.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,That confirms my fear. Separate bookings lead to uneven bills.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The inn has fixed mealtimes, which might help structure our days together.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Fixed mealtimes mean we are together at least twice a day.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I like the idea of fixed times, but I need a place to sit.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,So the island is expensive and has one bathroom. The city is flexible but messy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,The spa town seems to have a clear structure and lower travel time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I think the spa town offers a good mix of togetherness and some privacy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The train is fast and the inn has a set routine.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am worried about the futons in one room, but the baths are good.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
