60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Option A is the island, B is the city, and C is the hot spring town.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,I am leaning towards C. The costs are clearer and travel is shorter.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,I also prefer C. It seems to address the balance of time together and alone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,C is the only one that does not waste two days on travel.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am nervous about the shared room in C, but the baths are appealing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, the city has separate rooms, so you would have your own space.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,But the city has no structure. We might not see each other at all.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"The inn in C has a public bath and streets, so you can step out if needed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The city is too chaotic for me. I want a set plan.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think I can manage the inn if I know the bathing hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I will vote for C. It seems the most organized for the group.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. C minimizes the financial and logistical risks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I vote for C. It feels like the right balance for us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for C. The efficiency is decisive for me.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will vote for C. I hope the baths are enough for me.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,It looks like everyone is on board with the hot spring town.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, the clarity is worth it.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I am glad we found a place that works for all of us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Let's book the train tickets soon.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you for listening to my concerns.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
